# Nominative and abbreviated names: Unicode CLDR 47, locale lv, gregorian
# wide and abbreviated weekday names.  The locative is the adverbial "on
# <weekday>" form ("sanāksme ir pirmdienā"); genitive and accusative from the
# en.wiktionary.org declension table.  The short adverbial "pirmdien" ships
# for MONDAY ONLY, the one value attested in running text; the parallel forms
# for the other six days are a regular pattern nothing sources, so they are
# left out rather than invented.
pirmdiena
pirmdienā
pirmdienu
pirmdien
